# NOTICE

bay includes documentation carried from third-party projects.

## HyperFrames

`src/main/mcp/docs/compositions/` contains documents from the HyperFrames project:

  https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes

Copyright the HyperFrames authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of
that licence is available at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

The documents are carried unmodified apart from a provenance header added to each. They are
served to agents over bay's MCP interface as reference material, because bay renders HyperFrames
compositions and an agent authoring one has to satisfy the same contract bay's renderer enforces.
Paraphrasing them into bay's own words would have produced a second copy that drifts from the
renderer on the first edit to either.

bay implements the composition contract itself and does not depend on any HyperFrames package at
build or run time.

